WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.710
Here is one half on a number line.

00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:04.700
Split every piece in two:

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.240
two quarters.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:07.900
Split again:

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.170
four eighths.

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:11.250
The point never moved.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.200
Only the tick marks got finer.

